    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "team_0070_cassiopeia_12",
      "hash64": "54BAC9E74487B0CE",
      "text": "不喜欢显山露水的真老大没有自己的基地，\\n也一直在隐藏真实身份。[VAR 0x0114(0009)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
