    },
    {
      "ordinal": 36,
      "label": "team_0070_botan_04",
      "hash64": "29E67690A8C5E2DC",
      "text": "啊啊啊啊～……！！[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 9,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 37,
      "label": "team_0070_botan_05",
      "hash64": "29E67790A8C5E48F",
      "text": "幕后黑手的存在……\\n我也从仙后那里听说了。[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 38,
      "label": "team_0070_botan_06",
      "hash64": "29E67890A8C5E642",
      "text": "天星队的创始者，\\n万恶之源……[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 39,
      "label": "team_0070_botan_07",
      "hash64": "29E67990A8C5E7F5",
      "text": "如果不打倒那家伙的话，\\n我就会失去我的宝物……[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 40,
      "label": "team_0070_select_03",
      "hash64": "C5B8E79DED5EA3C5",
      "text": "怎么回事？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 41,
      "label": "team_0070_select_04",
      "hash64": "C5B8E09DED5E97E0",
      "text": "牡丹的宝物？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 42,
      "label": "team_0070_botan_08",
      "hash64": "29E67A90A8C5E9A8",
      "text": "啊，呃，这个嘛……[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 9,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 43,
      "label": "team_0070_botan_09",
      "hash64": "29E67B90A8C5EB5B",
      "text": "那个……报酬！\\n趁我还没忘……嗯！[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
